    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336055
    m_Localized: RUN PAUSED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336056
    m_Localized: Your route is frozen. Finishing early completes the trip without
      loot or a fuel refund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336057
    m_Localized: FINISH TRIP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336058
    m_Localized: HULL LOST
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336059
    m_Localized: Revive with half hull and 3 seconds of protection. Each revive reduces
      your grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336060
    m_Localized: No revives remain. You can still finish the trip, without loot or
      a fuel refund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336061
    m_Localized: "REVIVE \xB7 FREE"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336062
    m_Localized: "REVIVE \xB7 VIEW OFFER"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336063
    m_Localized: "WAITING FOR OFFER\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336064
    m_Localized: GRADE {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336065
    m_Localized: TRIP COMPLETE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336066
    m_Localized: "{0} kills  \xB7  best combo x{1}\n{2} hits  \xB7  {3} revives"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336067
    m_Localized: Clean run!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336068
    m_Localized: "+{0:N0} gal refunded  \xB7  +{1} XP"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336069
    m_Localized: 'You reached your destination.

      No loot or fuel refund for
      an unfinished run.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336070
    m_Localized: CONTINUE TO DESTINATION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336071
    m_Localized: Build a Lumber Camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336072
    m_Localized: Gather your first wood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336073
    m_Localized: Build a Warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336074
    m_Localized: Craft your first recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336075
    m_Localized: Clear an alien wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336076
    m_Localized: Land on a new world
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336077
    m_Localized: Prepare for your first departure. A Lumber Camp supplies wood for
      your first base.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336078
    m_Localized: Tap your Lumber Camp, then HARVEST wood. Better timing brings back
      more cargo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336079
    m_Localized: Store extra cargo in a Warehouse on this world to make room for
      your next haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336080
    m_Localized: Turn gathered materials into supplies at a Refinery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336081
    m_Localized: Call a wave from an Alarm when your defenses are ready. Victories
      earn XP for better equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336082
    m_Localized: Open the map, choose a reachable world, and spend fuel to land there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336083
    m_Localized: Skip first-session objectives
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336084
    m_Localized: '{0} / {1}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336085
    m_Localized: Your frontier is open
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336086
    m_Localized: You have built, gathered, crafted, defended, traveled, researched
      and upgraded. Find your next milestone in Menu > How to Play.
