  - m_Id: 1991336123
    m_Localized: Fuel Depot stores ship-fuel resources only. Its upgraded racks hold
      larger fuel stacks; reserves stay on this planet and never pay travel costs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336124
    m_Localized: This hopper stores the Auto-Harvester's offline output. A local
      Cargo Depot connects its materials to this planet's shared resource pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336125
    m_Localized: This shared buffer joins operational Warehouses and Auto-Harvester
      hoppers on this planet. Building, crafting, research and upgrades draw from
      the pool. Travel uses ship fuel; remote storage stays separate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336126
    m_Localized: Connected to this planet's Cargo Depot. Building, crafting, research
      and upgrades can draw from this storage automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1991336127
    m_Localized: Drag a stack between the grids. Resources stay on this planet. Costs
      use the backpack until a Cargo Depot connects its storage.
