    m_Localized: PRIVACY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530313
    m_Localized: Choices save locally. Online ranks are available to all players
      who opt in. Posting ranks sends Unity an anonymous player identifier and your
      Frontier Score; connecting also exposes normal connection data such as your
      IP address. No public name, email or birthday is requested. Scores upload only
      when you choose to post them. Analytics, ads and cloud saves have separate
      availability and controls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
