    m_Localized: Online ranks are unavailable until Unity services, a leaderboard
      and an HTTPS privacy policy are configured and approved. Your local record
      remains available above.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530393
    m_Localized: Online rankings are optional. Enabling them connects through an
      anonymous player ID; opening the leaderboard uploads your Frontier Score. No
      public name, email or birthday is needed. Unity receives connection data such
      as your IP address. You can turn online services off in Privacy Settings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530394
    m_Localized: Opening this page uploads your current Frontier Score and loads
      the top 20. Pilot labels are anonymous; scores are client-reported.
