  - m_Id: 1995530409
    m_Localized: ONLINE SAVE & ACCOUNT DELETION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530410
    m_Localized: Delete this signed-in account's Frontier cloud save and online account.
      Local progress and the local restore backup are kept; use Reset Progress separately
      to erase those. This does not claim to remove store purchase history, leaderboard
      or analytics records.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530411
    m_Localized: Online deletion is unavailable until account and cloud-save services
      are configured. No online data has been deleted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530412
    m_Localized: Sign in to the account you want to delete using Save Recovery above,
      then return here. Deletion never creates or signs in to an account automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530413
    m_Localized: DELETE ONLINE SAVE & ACCOUNT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530414
    m_Localized: CONFIRM PERMANENT ONLINE DELETION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530415
    m_Localized: This cannot be undone. Your Frontier cloud save is removed first;
      only then is the signed-in account deleted. If account deletion fails afterward,
      the cloud save remains deleted and you must retry. Local progress is kept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1995530416
    m_Localized: CANCEL DELETION
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
