  - m_Id: 1500709437661290
    m_Localized: void exposure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514418638848
    m_Localized: Wood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719232
    m_Localized: Timber from the lush worlds, cut green and stacked by the cartload.
      Every settlement begins with it, and every great project comes back to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719233
    m_Localized: Timber from the lush worlds, cut green and stacked by the cartload.
      Every settlement begins with it, and every great project comes back to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719234
    m_Localized: Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719235
    m_Localized: Dense grey rock that rings when struck. It holds the foundations
      of everything and never runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719236
    m_Localized: Dense grey rock that rings when struck. It holds the foundations
      of everything and never runs out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719237
    m_Localized: Scrap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719238
    m_Localized: Wreckage and worn-out machinery lie on every world, because someone
      always got there first. Pressed, burned or melted, none of it is ever wasted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719239
    m_Localized: Wreckage and worn-out machinery lie on every world, because someone
      always got there first. Pressed, burned or melted, none of it is ever wasted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719240
    m_Localized: Biomass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719241
    m_Localized: Fast-growing fibrous growth, thick with sap and spores. It ferments
      into clean fuel and weaves into seals that shrug off poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719242
    m_Localized: Fast-growing fibrous growth, thick with sap and spores. It ferments
      into clean fuel and weaves into seals that shrug off poison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719243
    m_Localized: Iron Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719244
    m_Localized: Rust-red ore heavy with metal, found in veins under volcanic crust
      and dry plains. Smelted, it becomes the skeleton of everything you build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719245
    m_Localized: Rust-red ore heavy with metal, found in veins under volcanic crust
      and dry plains. Smelted, it becomes the skeleton of everything you build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719246
    m_Localized: Copper Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719247
    m_Localized: Green-streaked ore that conducts better than anything else you can
      dig up. Drawn into wire, it carries every signal and every current.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719248
    m_Localized: Green-streaked ore that conducts better than anything else you can
      dig up. Drawn into wire, it carries every signal and every current.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719249
    m_Localized: Silica
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719250
    m_Localized: Fine quartz sand from the dry basins and crystal flats. Melted it
      turns to glass, and ground it polishes lenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719251
    m_Localized: Fine quartz sand from the dry basins and crystal flats. Melted it
      turns to glass, and ground it polishes lenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719252
    m_Localized: Ice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719253
    m_Localized: Hard blue ice cut from glaciers, comet shells and shadowed craters.
      It holds the cold that cryogenic hulls and quantum lattices depend on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719254
    m_Localized: Hard blue ice cut from glaciers, comet shells and shadowed craters.
      It holds the cold that cryogenic hulls and quantum lattices depend on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719255
    m_Localized: Titanium Ore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719256
    m_Localized: Grey ore so dense it blunts ordinary drills. Refined, it turns light,
      strong and unbothered by fire or vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719257
    m_Localized: Grey ore so dense it blunts ordinary drills. Refined, it turns light,
      strong and unbothered by fire or vacuum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719258
    m_Localized: Crystal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719259
    m_Localized: Resonant crystal that hums when struck and glows when worked. It
      sharpens tools, focuses beams and stores more energy than it should.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719260
    m_Localized: Resonant crystal that hums when struck and glows when worked. It
      sharpens tools, focuses beams and stores more energy than it should.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719261
    m_Localized: Methane
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719262
    m_Localized: Pale gas siphoned from swamps, oceans and giant worlds. A little
      of it burns hotter than a hold full of wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719263
    m_Localized: Pale gas siphoned from swamps, oceans and giant worlds. A little
      of it burns hotter than a hold full of wood.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719264
    m_Localized: Helium-3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719265
    m_Localized: A rare light gas drifting in the storm bands of the giants. Ships
      crave it, and so does every quantum machine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719266
    m_Localized: A rare light gas drifting in the storm bands of the giants. Ships
      crave it, and so does every quantum machine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719267
    m_Localized: Xeno Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719268
    m_Localized: A pulsing organic knot torn from alien hives and fallen raiders.
      Nobody agrees what it is, but every advanced machine runs better with one inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719269
    m_Localized: A pulsing organic knot torn from alien hives and fallen raiders.
      Nobody agrees what it is, but every advanced machine runs better with one inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514506719270
    m_Localized: Radium
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913536
    m_Localized: A faintly glowing salt that ticks in the dark. Dangerous to carry,
      essential for shielding, and priceless to anyone who knows how to contain it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913537
    m_Localized: A faintly glowing salt that ticks in the dark. Dangerous to carry,
      essential for shielding, and priceless to anyone who knows how to contain it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913538
    m_Localized: Dark Matter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913539
    m_Localized: A pocket of nothing that pulls on everything. Dug from the deepest
      shattered worlds, it is the last ingredient of the last machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913540
    m_Localized: A pocket of nothing that pulls on everything. Dug from the deepest
      shattered worlds, it is the last ingredient of the last machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913541
    m_Localized: Fuel Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913542
    m_Localized: 'Compact cells of refined energy that power every jump. Cooked from
      whatever burns: wood in the first days, gas and ice when the ship is bigger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913543
    m_Localized: 'Compact cells of refined energy that power every jump. Cooked from
      whatever burns: wood in the first days, gas and ice when the ship is bigger.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913544
    m_Localized: Planks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913545
    m_Localized: Sawn timber cut to length. It frames the buildings of every era,
      and the late projects eat it by the thousand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913546
    m_Localized: Sawn timber cut to length. It frames the buildings of every era,
      and the late projects eat it by the thousand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913547
    m_Localized: Iron Plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913548
    m_Localized: Rolled sheets of smelted iron, still warm from the foundry. The
      first real building material of any colony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913549
    m_Localized: Rolled sheets of smelted iron, still warm from the foundry. The
      first real building material of any colony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913550
    m_Localized: Copper Wire
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913551
    m_Localized: Copper drawn thin and wound on spools. Everything with a pulse,
      from a lamp to a reactor, needs a length of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913552
    m_Localized: Copper drawn thin and wound on spools. Everything with a pulse,
      from a lamp to a reactor, needs a length of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913553
    m_Localized: Glass
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913554
    m_Localized: Clear, hard panes melted from silica. They keep out the weather,
      hold the vacuum and become lenses when polished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913555
    m_Localized: Clear, hard panes melted from silica. They keep out the weather,
      hold the vacuum and become lenses when polished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913556
    m_Localized: Titanium Plate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913557
    m_Localized: Pressed titanium cut into light, stubborn armor panels. It survives
      heat that melts steel and cold that shatters it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913558
    m_Localized: Pressed titanium cut into light, stubborn armor panels. It survives
      heat that melts steel and cold that shatters it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913559
    m_Localized: Steel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913560
    m_Localized: Iron hardened with the carbon of burnt timber. The backbone of tools,
      turrets and hulls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913561
    m_Localized: Iron hardened with the carbon of burnt timber. The backbone of tools,
      turrets and hulls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913562
    m_Localized: Biocomposite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913563
    m_Localized: Plant fibre pressed with resin into a flexible, self-sealing skin.
      Toxic air eats steel but slides off this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913564
    m_Localized: Plant fibre pressed with resin into a flexible, self-sealing skin.
      Toxic air eats steel but slides off this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913565
    m_Localized: Thermal Alloy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913566
    m_Localized: Titanium and glass fused into a ceramic-bright metal that glows
      without failing. Hulls plated with it can land where rock still flows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913567
    m_Localized: Titanium and glass fused into a ceramic-bright metal that glows
      without failing. Hulls plated with it can land where rock still flows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913568
    m_Localized: Cryo Composite
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913569
    m_Localized: A foam-cored laminate that keeps its strength far below freezing.
      It lets a ship set down where the air itself is ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913570
    m_Localized: A foam-cored laminate that keeps its strength far below freezing.
      It lets a ship set down where the air itself is ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913571
    m_Localized: Rad-Shield Alloy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913572
    m_Localized: Layered steel and radium-laced glass that drinks hard radiation.
      Shielding like this opens the worlds that glow in the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913573
    m_Localized: Layered steel and radium-laced glass that drinks hard radiation.
      Shielding like this opens the worlds that glow in the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913574
    m_Localized: Void Alloy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913575
    m_Localized: A black metal grown around a seed of dark matter. It bends light
      and survives where space itself is thin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913576
    m_Localized: A black metal grown around a seed of dark matter. It bends light
      and survives where space itself is thin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913577
    m_Localized: Circuit Board
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913578
    m_Localized: Etched copper on a glass-fibre sheet. Every control, sensor and
      drone starts with one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913579
    m_Localized: Etched copper on a glass-fibre sheet. Every control, sensor and
      drone starts with one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913580
    m_Localized: Servo Motor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913581
    m_Localized: A sealed motor with a precision gearhead. It moves every arm, drill
      carriage and turret in the colony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913582
    m_Localized: A sealed motor with a precision gearhead. It moves every arm, drill
      carriage and turret in the colony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913583
    m_Localized: Optic Lens
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913584
    m_Localized: A ground and polished lens, flawless enough to focus a laser or
      read a star. Scanners and turrets are blind without it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913585
    m_Localized: A ground and polished lens, flawless enough to focus a laser or
      read a star. Scanners and turrets are blind without it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913586
    m_Localized: Quantum Chip
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913587
    m_Localized: A lattice of cooled helium and etched crystal that computes in more
      than one state at once. Navigation and research run on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913588
    m_Localized: A lattice of cooled helium and etched crystal that computes in more
      than one state at once. Navigation and research run on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913589
    m_Localized: Warp Coil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913590
    m_Localized: A superconducting coil wound around a speck of dark matter. Charge
      it and space folds; it is the last part of every great ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913591
    m_Localized: A superconducting coil wound around a speck of dark matter. Charge
      it and space folds; it is the last part of every great ship.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913592
    m_Localized: Plasma Cell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913593
    m_Localized: A magnetic bottle of superheated gas that carries eight times the
      energy of a fuel cell. It lets a deep run fit in a few slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913594
    m_Localized: A magnetic bottle of superheated gas that carries eight times the
      energy of a fuel cell. It lets a deep run fit in a few slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913595
    m_Localized: Antimatter Pod
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913596
    m_Localized: A pod of trapped antiparticles in a mirrored field. Sixty-four cells
      of energy in a package you can hold, and a carelessness you cannot survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913597
    m_Localized: A pod of trapped antiparticles in a mirrored field. Sixty-four cells
      of energy in a package you can hold, and a carelessness you cannot survive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913598
    m_Localized: Lumber Camp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913599
    m_Localized: Tap it to chop the trees on this planet. Higher levels yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913600
    m_Localized: Mining Rig
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913601
    m_Localized: Tap it to mine stone and ore on this planet. Free to build. Higher
      levels yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913602
    m_Localized: Deep Driller
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913603
    m_Localized: Tap it to drill ore, crystal and xeno cores. Higher levels yield
      more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913604
    m_Localized: Biodome Harvester
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913605
    m_Localized: Tap it to harvest the plant growth on this planet. Higher levels
      yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913606
    m_Localized: Gas Siphon Rig
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913607
    m_Localized: Tap it to siphon gas from the atmosphere. Higher levels yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913608
    m_Localized: Excavation Rig
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913609
    m_Localized: Tap it to excavate buried ice, sand and rare salts. Higher levels
      yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913610
    m_Localized: Salvage Yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913611
    m_Localized: Sorts wreckage into scrap and the occasional cache. Higher levels
      yield more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913612
    m_Localized: Refinery
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913613
    m_Localized: Converts raw materials into fuel and planks. Higher levels unlock
      better recipes and larger craft batches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913614
    m_Localized: Fabricator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913615
    m_Localized: Draws wire and assembles components. Higher levels unlock better
      recipes and larger craft batches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913616
    m_Localized: Foundry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913617
    m_Localized: Smelts ore into plates and alloys. Higher levels unlock tougher
      alloys and larger craft batches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514510913618
    m_Localized: Chem Reactor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107840
    m_Localized: Mixes composites and charges plasma cells.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107841
    m_Localized: Quantum Lab
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107842
    m_Localized: Etches quantum chips and grows void alloy, warp coils and antimatter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107843
    m_Localized: Warehouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107844
    m_Localized: Stores resources on this planet. Drag stacks between your backpack
      and storage. The first upgrades add 9 slots each; the late ones add far more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107845
    m_Localized: Fuel Depot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107846
    m_Localized: Holds fuel cells, plasma and antimatter in dense racks that do not
      use backpack slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107847
    m_Localized: Cargo Depot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107848
    m_Localized: Pools every warehouse on this planet, so crafting and building draw
      from all of them at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107849
    m_Localized: Orbital Relay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107850
    m_Localized: Withdraw from operational warehouses on visited worlds in this system;
      upgrades extend its beam and reduce transfer energy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107851
    m_Localized: Gunner Turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107852
    m_Localized: Rapid fire kinetic turret. Fires during waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107853
    m_Localized: Laser Turret
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107854
    m_Localized: Slow, heavy beam with long range. Fires during waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107855
    m_Localized: Shield Pylon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107856
    m_Localized: Projects a field that raises reactor health.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107857
    m_Localized: Missile Silo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107858
    m_Localized: Launches a splash missile that clears clustered raiders. Fires during
      waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107859
    m_Localized: Tesla Coil
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107860
    m_Localized: Arcs lightning between nearby aliens. Fires during waves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107861
    m_Localized: Repair Bay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107862
    m_Localized: Slowly repairs the reactor during a wave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1502514515107863
    m_Localized: Alarm Beacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
