    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2102386658205697
    m_Localized: One upgrade improves both vein mining and pressure drilling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2102386658205698
    m_Localized: FOLLOW THE VEIN
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2102386658205699
    m_Localized: Steer through gold crystal seams. Hold SPEED (Space) to drill twice
      as fast. Three rich seams in a row repair the rig.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2102386658205700
