  - m_Id: 2188116801708032
    m_Localized: SHIP FUEL TANKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428288
    m_Localized: FUEL TANKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428289
    m_Localized: '{0} gal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428290
    m_Localized: '{0}M gal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428291
    m_Localized: '{0}B gal'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428292
    m_Localized: '{0} / {1} tank racks occupied'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428293
    m_Localized: Ship fuel is measured in equivalent gallons. Plasma and antimatter
      hold more energy per rack. Refill by crafting fuel or withdrawing from a local
      Fuel Depot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428294
    m_Localized: Your previous reserves are safe, even above capacity. Burn or store
      some fuel, or upgrade the tanks, before refilling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428295
    m_Localized: UPGRADE TANKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428296
    m_Localized: PLANET NETWORK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428297
    m_Localized: Build a Warp Gate on each visited world, then permanently link them.
      Connected worlds cost no fuel and have no flight mini-game. Hull protection
      still applies. Solid green map lines show your links.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428298
    m_Localized: Finish the current journey or resolve the read-only save before
      changing the network.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428299
    m_Localized: Planet network content is unavailable in this build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428300
    m_Localized: Select another valid world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428301
    m_Localized: These worlds already share a permanent connection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428302
    m_Localized: Visit this world and build its Warp Gate first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428303
    m_Localized: Both worlds need a completed level {0} Warp Gate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428304
    m_Localized: Upgrade your hull protection before landing on this world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428305
    m_Localized: Bring the required resources to this world or its pooled warehouses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428306
    m_Localized: The Grand Archive is already online.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428307
    m_Localized: Build a Warp Gate and Cargo Depot on your archive world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428308
    m_Localized: Link a different supply world for each resource shown above.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428309
    m_Localized: Dedicate this world to storage with at least {0} warehouses and
      {1:N0} warehouse slots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428310
    m_Localized: LINK {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428311
    m_Localized: '{0} permanently linked. Free network travel is ready.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428312
    m_Localized: PERMANENT LINK ACTIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428313
    m_Localized: Free passage - no fuel, no flight mini-game
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428314
    m_Localized: GATE TRANSIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428315
    m_Localized: LIGHTSPEED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428316
    m_Localized: THE GRAND ARCHIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428317
    m_Localized: Unite five different supply worlds, then build a warehouse world
      to hold the final shipment. Your archive world is the hub, not one of the five
      suppliers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428318
    m_Localized: Supply world needed
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428319
    m_Localized: FIND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428320
    m_Localized: 'Archive world: {0}/{1} warehouses - {2:N0}/{3:N0} storage slots'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428321
    m_Localized: Choose a large world. Reserve five pads of capacity for its Warp
      Gate and Cargo Depot, and devote the rest to warehouses. Upgrade them, fill
      the pooled storage, then commission the archive here. This consumes the shipment
      once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428322
    m_Localized: COMMISSION GRAND ARCHIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428323
    m_Localized: YOUR WORLDS, UNITED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428324
    m_Localized: Lightspeed unlocked. Travel instantly to any previously visited
      world, even without a gate link. No fuel. No flight mini-game. Your worlds
      and progress are yours to keep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428325
    m_Localized: LINK FROM THIS WORLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428326
    m_Localized: No other visited world has a completed Warp Gate yet. Build one
      there, return here, then link it on the map or in this list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428327
    m_Localized: OPEN PLANET MAP
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428328
    m_Localized: REPLAY FINALE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428329
    m_Localized: REVIEW OPTIONAL PRESTIGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428330
    m_Localized: 'Could not save the network change. Nothing was spent. Retry after
      fixing storage: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428331
    m_Localized: FROM ONE SMALL WORLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428332
    m_Localized: Every harvest, every expedition, every world you returned to brought
      you here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428333
    m_Localized: A GALAXY WITHIN REACH
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428334
    m_Localized: Five supply worlds. One great archive. Your frontier is finally
      connected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428335
    m_Localized: DISTANCE IS NO LONGER A LIMIT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428336
    m_Localized: THANK YOU FOR PLAYING SPHEER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428337
    m_Localized: Keep exploring with lightspeed, or review a fresh universe with
      a permanent harvest bonus. Prestige is optional and always asks before resetting
      anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2188116860428338
    m_Localized: KEEP EXPLORING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
