    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2230690140741640
    m_Localized: Online rankings could not be configured. Check that this build is
      linked to the Unity cloud project and has its leaderboard ID and HTTPS privacy-policy
      URL. Your local record remains available.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2230690140741641
    m_Localized: Rankings are read-only. This build does not submit your local score.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2230690140741642
    m_Localized: The Editor cannot display real iOS ads. Install an iOS Development
      Build on your iPhone to use the LevelPlay test suite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2230690140741643
    m_Localized: LevelPlay tests require an iOS Development Build with test diagnostics
      enabled. Release builds and Android cannot open this suite.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2230690140741644
    m_Localized: Register this iPhone as a LevelPlay test device. In the suite choose
      Unity Ads > Test > Rewarded, not Live. Gameplay ads remain disabled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2235406174216192
    m_Localized: ONLINE RANKS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2235406253907968
