    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2235406253907970
    m_Localized: Online rankings are enabled. Open Menu > Ranks, opt in, then post
      your score. No age gate or public player name is used. Ads, analytics and cloud
      saves are separate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2235406253907971
    m_Localized: A leaderboard ID and a nonnegative integer score no greater than
      9,007,199,254,740,991 are required.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
